        <Text style={{ marginTop: 18, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>LEARNING OBJECTIVES</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 观察受影响状态沿同区与允许跨区服务扩散</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 验证终端防护如何阻止目标进入受影响状态</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>· 在保护文件服务与业务连续性之间权衡</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#6BC8D1', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>WATCH FOR</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>PC-02 是 seed；Office → File 的 FILE 业务默认可达；启用 File 终端防护后，通信仍通但状态不再改变。</Text>

        <Text style={{ marginTop: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', fontSize: 9, color: '#E78172', letterSpacing: 1.2 }}>TASK</Text>
        <Text style={{ marginTop: 7, fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', fontSize: 10.3, color: 'rgba(242,247,248,0.58)', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>保护 File Server，同时保持办公 Web、办公文件、应用数据库三条业务可达。</Text>

